So, the Dark Watch team will end up only having one although each. So, I decided to brainstorming &nbsp;some of my own.here&#39;s what I came up withBlack Fist - (Young Mr. Fixer) - Balanced strike - Discard up to 3 cards. Deal 1 target X damage where x is the number of cards you have discarded this turn.Nightmist - Wild Magic - Reveal the bottom card of your deck. Put it in play.Setback - Karma- Remove any number of tokens from your unlucky pool. For each you remove, gain one life.Expatriette - Weaponsmith - Reveal the bottom card of your deck. If it is an equipment card, put it in your hand. Otherwise, discard it.&nbsp;&nbsp;Thoughts?

