I worry that the Fixer one would mean he&#39;d run out of cards very quickly. He doesn&#39;t have much in the way of draw powers, so that his hand will get empty real quick unless he&#39;s on a team with TL Tachyon.

&nbsp;

I like the idea for the Expatriette one, but just getting cards in her hands probably won&#39;t be enough. How about if it is an equipment card, put it into play.&nbsp;
